   "<<effects>>",
   "",
   "<<museumClearHint \"antiqueshovelhandle\">>",
   "<<npc Winter>><<person1>>",
   "",
   "Winter touches the handle gingerly. \"This is barely being held together. Decades of water damage has almost destroyed this piece,\" <<he>> says.",
   "<br><br>",
   "<<link [[Next|Museum]]>><<endevent>><</link>>",
   "",
