   "<<effects>>",
   "",
   "<<museumClearHint \"antiquelantern\">>",
   "<<npc Winter>><<person1>>",
   "",
   "Winter holds the lantern. \"This design was common in the 1930s,\" <<he>> says. \"Built to last. I wouldn't be surprised if it still worked.\"",
   "<br><br>",
   "<<link [[Next|Museum]]>><<endevent>><</link>>",
   "",
   ":: Museum Rusty Pickaxe",
   "<<effects>>",
   "",
   "<<museumClearHint \"antiquerustypickaxe\">>",
   "<<npc Winter>><<person1>>",
   "",
