   "",
   "Winter stares at the diamond, enraptured. You grab <<his>> shoulder and shake <<him>>. It seems to snap <<him>> out of it. \"Sorry, I don't know what got into me,\" <<he>> says looking embarrassed. \"Where did you even find this?\"",
   "<br><br>",
   "You tell <<him>> about how you cleared a collapsed section of the mines and swam through a flooded tunnel, ending with the strange room you found it in. <<He>> listens intently. \"You went in the mines! You shouldn't go back there, the mines are extremely dangerous. They were shut down for a reason.\"",
   "<br><br>",
   "<<link [[Next|Museum]]>><<endevent>><</link>>"
